title: Streetfighting
new-page: true
is-card: true
on-arrival: streetfighting_timer = 6; month_actions += 1; ugt_militia_cost = 2 if ugt_militia_militancy > 0.15 else ugt_militia_cost = 1; ugt_militia_cost = 3 if ugt_militia_militancy > 0.3; strife += 1
view-if: year >= 1932 and (falange_militia_strength*falange_militia_militancy + requetes_strength*requetes_militancy) >= 80 and streetfighting_timer == 0 and not return_to_normalcy
card-image: img/blutmai_2.jpg
tags: party_affairs; antifascism

= Streetfighting

Battles rage on the streets between the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Falange**</span>, the monarchist <span style="color: #2E3B6E;">**Requetés**</span>, the anarcho-syndicalist <span style="color: #333333;">**CNT**</span>, and our own <span style="color: #700000;">**UGT Militia**</span>. In some parts of the country, conditions are nearing civil war levels, as dozens of people are killed each month.

We must do something to protect the workers against these predations.

- @arm_rb: Increase training and armaments for the militia.
- @if_training: Train union members to fight as part of the Alianza Obrera.
- @asalto_training: Use the Guardia de Asalto to help train the militia.
- @peace: Try to avoid all militant confrontations, as much as possible.
- @truce_cnt: Try to make peace with the <span style="color: #333333;">**CNT**</span>.
- @easy_discard

@battle
view-if: ugt_militia_militancy > 0.15 and ugt_militia_militancy < 0.5
on-arrival: ugt_militia_militancy += 0.1; falange_militia_strength += 40; ugt_militia_strength -= 100;
max-visits: 1

Many militia members are not ready for actual fighting, and thus quit. However, the remainder are toughened as a result. Our confrontations also provide ample recruiting material for the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Falange**</span>.

@arm_rb
subtitle: -[+ ugt_militia_cost +] resource
choose-if: resources >= ugt_militia_cost
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources ([+ ugt_militia_cost +] needed).
on-arrival: resources -= ugt_militia_cost; ugt_militia_militancy += 0.06; ugt_militia_strength += 50; falange_militia_strength += 50; ceda_relation -= 3 if strife < 5; izq_rep_relation -= 3 if strife < 5

We have increased training and purchased more armaments for the militia.

[? if strife < 5: The <span style="color: #4a7d3a;">**Republican Left**</span> decries the militarization of the militia. ?][? if strife >= 5: Seeing the strife that has filled Spain's streets, the <span style="color: #4a7d3a;">**Republican Left**</span> and <span style="color: #d9a441;">Radicals</span> seem convinced that it is necessary, and mute their criticisms. ?]

@if_training
view-if: iron_front_formed == 1
on-arrival: ugt_militia_militancy += 0.03; ugt_militia_strength += 200; falange_militia_strength += 50;
max-visits: 2

As part of the Alianza Obrera, we are increasing coordination between the militia and the union, and many members want to become more involved.

@asalto_training
view-if: asalto_loyalty > 0.5
on-arrival: ugt_militia_militancy += 0.05; falange_militia_strength += 50; asalto_training += 1

The loyal Guardia de Asalto can help train the militia.

@peace
on-arrival: ugt_militia_militancy -= 0.02; ugt_militia_strength -= 50; pacifism += 1

By not fighting, the strength of the militia atrophies. Pacifists in the party are gaining the upper hand.

@truce_cnt
subtitle: The <span style="color: #333333;">**CNT**</span> will be added to the balance of power.
choose-if: anarchist_militancy <= 0.5
view-if: cnt_truce == 0
unavailable-subtitle: The <span style="color: #333333;">**CNT**</span> is not interested.
on-arrival: cnt_truce = 1; anarchist_militancy -= 0.05; cnt_militia_strength += 50; ugt_militia_strength += 50; falange_militia_strength += 50;

We have made at least a temporary truce with the <span style="color: #333333;">**CNT**</span>, so that our respective militias will stop fighting.
